<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes of feed barley.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for 25,000 tonnes of feed barley.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus on Wednesday invited tenders for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of feed barley for shipment in December or January.</p>
<p>Tenders close on December 3, a statement from the Cyprus Grain Commission said.</p>
</text>
